# Use Bun

This project uses **Bun** as the package manager. Do NOT use npm, pnpm, or yarn.

```bash
# ✅ CORRECT
bun install
bun add <package>
bun run dev
bun run build
bun prisma migrate dev

# ❌ WRONG - Never use these
npm install
pnpm install
yarn install
npx prisma migrate dev
```

When running any shell commands, always use `bun` instead of npm/pnpm/yarn/npx.
